title: Clousight Bench
message: >-
  If you use Clousight Bench or cite results it produced, please cite it using
  the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Clousight Bench contributors
url: https://clousight.com
repository-code: https://github.com/clousight/clousight-bench
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.6.0
date-released: "2026-09-05"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - cloud
  - agent-runtime
  - reproducibility
  - evidence-graded
abstract: >-
  Clousight Bench is a reproducible, evidence-graded benchmarking framework for
  cloud products. It measures the runtime engineering of managed cloud services
  (session hosting, tool-failure recovery, trace completeness, cost attribution)
  through a shared lifecycle and a per-dimension result contract with three-axis
  fingerprints — open methods anyone can reproduce, never a blended vanity score.
